OpenMagicka fork of MojoShader (altered source, see native/README.md).

Metal (SDL_GPU): integer vertex formats (BYTE4 bone indices, SHORT2, SHORT4) are read into uint4/int4
and converted to float4, as the SPIR-V path patches them; Metal read them as float4 garbage. Applies
after 0006.

diff --git a/mojoshader_sdlgpu.c b/mojoshader_sdlgpu.c
